WEBVTT

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:03.666
You're busy on the job. Your phone rings, but you can't answer.

00:00:03.666 --> 00:00:08.000
And just like that, a customer can move on to your competitor.

00:00:08.400 --> 00:00:16.500
Meet the TradeCatch Receptionist. It answers your calls as your business, in French or English, even when you can't pick up.

00:00:16.900 --> 00:00:20.970
Receptionist: Thank you for calling NorthStar Plumbing! How can I help you today?

00:00:20.970 --> 00:00:26.210
Caller: Hi, my kitchen sink is leaking. Do you do repairs in Laval?

00:00:26.210 --> 00:00:31.190
Receptionist: Yes, we serve Laval and the surrounding area. Is the leak causing any flooding?

00:00:31.190 --> 00:00:34.710
Caller: No, but I'd like someone to come by tomorrow.

00:00:34.710 --> 00:00:37.720
Receptionist: Of course. What time works best for you?

00:00:37.720 --> 00:00:40.130
Caller: Around ten in the morning.

00:00:40.130 --> 00:00:47.500
Receptionist: Perfect. I've sent your request for tomorrow at 10 a.m. to the team. They'll text you shortly to confirm.

00:00:47.900 --> 00:00:52.450
Caller: My basement is flooding! I need to speak to someone right now.

00:00:52.450 --> 00:00:58.090
Receptionist: I understand, this is urgent. I'm connecting you to the on-call technician right away.

00:00:58.090 --> 00:01:02.500
Emergencies you define go straight to your on-call line.

00:01:02.900 --> 00:01:08.157
Every call lands in one workspace: the lead, the call summary and the appointment request.

00:01:08.157 --> 00:01:14.500
Your team confirms the visit in one click, without leaving the job.

00:01:14.900 --> 00:01:22.500
And when a call goes unanswered or a quote goes quiet, automatic follow-ups keep the conversation moving.

00:01:22.900 --> 00:01:25.972
Stop letting opportunities slip away. TradeCatch:

00:01:25.972 --> 00:01:27.700
every call counts.

00:01:27.700 --> 00:01:29.452
Illustrative demo with a fictional business.

00:01:29.452 --> 00:01:31.324
The Receptionist is a founder-configured pilot;

00:01:31.324 --> 00:01:33.500
features vary by plan.
